While saving a resource, we dont want to post improper data like improper emails etc,we perform validations.
We make use of DTOs on top of it, we use validation annotations.
1. we add the spring validation dependancy in the project.
2. we annotate @valid in the Request body of the method.
3. If the conditions are not satisfied, MethodArgumentNotValidException.
4. We use @RestControllerAdvice and handle such errors.
